<bottom-sheet show="{{show}}" title="换盆记录" bind:close="onCancel">
  <view class="rs-intro">换好了就可以记一笔，托蕾妮会据此调整接下来的浇水和施肥。</view>

  <view class="rs-row">
    <text class="rs-label">换成多大的盆</text>
    <picker
      mode="selector"
      range="{{potOptions}}"
      range-key="label"
      value="{{potIndex}}"
      bindchange="onPotChange"
    >
      <text class="rs-value">{{potLabel}} ›</text>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="rs-row">
    <text class="rs-label">用的是哪种土</text>
    <picker
      mode="selector"
      range="{{soilOptions}}"
      range-key="name"
      value="{{soilIndex}}"
      bindchange="onSoilChange"
    >
      <text class="rs-value">{{soilLabel}} ›</text>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="rs-note">
    <text class="rs-note-text">先不填也行，但浇水提醒会继续按原来的花盆估算。盆的大小影响每次要浇多少水，现在盆就在手边，是填准它最方便的时候。</text>
  </view>

  <view slot="footer" class="rs-foot">
    <button class="btn btn-outline rs-btn" bindtap="onSkip" disabled="{{saving}}">先不填</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary rs-btn" bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{saving}}">保存</button>
  </view>
</bottom-sheet>
